<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-RED STRIPE FIRST DAY SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE FIRST DAY SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the opening day of Red Stripe cricket matches:</p>
<p>Played on Thursday</p>
<p>In Discovery Bay, Jamaica: Windward Islands 117 (Laurie Williams 6-26), Jamaica 140-3 (Robert Samuels 65 not out)</p>
<p>In Basseterre, St Kitts: Barbados 206-7 (Roland Holder 69 not out, Floyd Reifer 61) v Leeward Islands.</p>
